        2
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Avon%2C_Minnesota"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Avon celebrated its centennial of incorporation in 2000 and published a history book titled \"Nestled between Lakes and Wooded Hills.\".",
